{title: I See Heaven}
{artist: Bryan & Katie Torwalt}
{key: F}
{tempo: 61}

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]I see [Bb]Heaven [F/A]invading this [Bb]place.
[F]I see [Bb]angels [F/A]praising Your [Bb]holy name and
[F/A]I sing praises, [Bb]I sing praises. I [F/A]give You honor, [Bb]worthy Jesus.

{comment: Verse 2}
I see glory falling in this place.
I see hope restore the healing of all diseases.
I sing praises, I sing praises. I give You honor, worthy Jesus.

{comment: Chorus}
[F]We give You praise and all of the honor.
[Bb]You are our God, the One we live for.
[F/A]We give You praise and all of the glory, [Bb]God.

Channel/Outro:
[F]And all of the glory.   [Bb]   And all of the glory.   [F/A]   [Bb]

{comment: Bridge}
[Gm]And let Your [F/A]presence fill [Bb]this place.  Let [F]Hea[C/E]ven [Gm]come.
Let Your [F/A]angels be [Bb]released.  Let [F]Hea[C/E]ven [Gm]come.
We [F/A]worship at Your [Bb]feet.  Let [F]Hea[C/E]ven [Gm]come.
Face to [F/A]face we want to be.[Bb]  Let [F]Hea[C/E]ven [Gm]come.
